cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HTR Error Dataset: generator for handwritten writing-error word pairs"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that builds (clean, corrupted) handwritten word-image pairs from
  the IAM Handwriting Database, where the corruption is a genuine handwritten
  glyph of one letter spliced over another letter by the same writer, for
  evaluating whether handwriting OCR/VLM systems transcribe faithfully or
  repair implausible text.
type: software
